---
import PartDetailLayout from "../../layouts/PartDetailLayout.astro";

const liveUrl = "https://yucongs-tarot.netlify.app/";
const meta = [
  {
    label: "Role",
    labelZh: "职责",
    value: "Concept, design & development",
    valueZh: "概念、设计与开发",
  },
  {
    label: "Type",
    labelZh: "类型",
    value: "Self-initiated project",
    valueZh: "独立项目",
  },
  {
    label: "Status",
    labelZh: "状态",
    value: "Live",
    valueZh: "已上线",
  },
];
---

<PartDetailLayout
  part="02"
  title="Quiet Tarot"
  titleZh="静谧塔罗"
  eyebrow="Independent Web Project"
  eyebrowZh="独立网页项目"
  statement="A small ritual for slowing down and listening to the question underneath the question."
  statementZh="用一个小小的仪式慢下来，听见问题背后真正想问的事。"
  description="Quiet Tarot is an interactive reading experience designed and built independently from concept to deployment. It offers a single-card reading for daily guidance and a three-card spread for past, present, and future."
  descriptionZh="静谧塔罗是一个从概念、视觉到开发部署均独立完成的交互式占卜体验，提供单张今日指引与过去、现在、未来三张牌阵。"
  image="/projects/yucongs-tarot.jpg"
  imageAlt="The dark purple and gold interface of Quiet Tarot"
  titleLeft="6%"
  titleLeftZh="11.4%"
  background="#221e34"
  foreground="#eee9df"
  accent="#d6b35f"
  {meta}
  nextHref="/notes/"
  nextTitle="Notes"
  nextTitleZh="随笔"
  nextImage="/xiaohongshu/6a803b2c0000000026034f93/images/01.webp"
  nextBackground="#dfeadf"
  nextAccent="#a96257"
>
  <section class="detail-chapter detail-chapter--split" data-detail-reveal>
    <header>
      <span>01</span>
      <p><span class="en-text">The idea</span><span class="zh-text">项目起点</span></p>
      <h2>
        <span class="en-text">Turn a reading into a quiet digital ritual</span>
        <span class="zh-text">把一次抽牌变成安静的数字仪式</span>
      </h2>
    </header>
    <div class="detail-prose">
      <p class="en-text">
        The experience avoids the noise of a typical tool. A restrained dark
        interface, deliberate pacing, and gold details create enough space for
        the question, the card, and the interpretation to remain the focus.
      </p>
      <p class="zh-text">
        这个体验刻意避开普通工具的嘈杂感。克制的深色界面、缓慢的节奏和少量金色细节，让问题、牌面与解读始终成为注意力中心。
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <figure class="detail-wide-media detail-wide-media--screen" data-detail-reveal>
    <img src="/projects/yucongs-tarot.jpg" alt="Quiet Tarot reading selection screen" loading="lazy" />
  </figure>

  <section class="detail-chapter detail-chapter--split" data-detail-reveal>
    <header>
      <span>02</span>
      <p><span class="en-text">The experience</span><span class="zh-text">体验结构</span></p>
      <h2>
        <span class="en-text">One card for direction. Three cards for a story.</span>
        <span class="zh-text">一张牌寻找方向，三张牌展开故事。</span>
      </h2>
    </header>
    <div class="detail-prose">
      <p class="en-text">
        The single-card reading gives a concise prompt for the day. The
        three-card spread creates a simple narrative across the past, present,
        and future, giving the reader more room to connect the cards to their
        own situation.
      </p>
      <p class="zh-text">
        单张牌提供简洁的今日指引；三张牌则沿着过去、现在和未来建立一条叙事，让使用者有更多空间把牌意与自己的处境连接起来。
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="detail-chapter detail-chapter--statement" data-detail-reveal>
    <p><span class="en-text">Try it yourself</span><span class="zh-text">亲自体验</span></p>
    <h2>
      <span class="en-text">Ask a question, choose a spread, and let the cards slow the moment down.</span>
      <span class="zh-text">写下问题，选择牌阵，让这一刻慢下来。</span>
    </h2>
    <a class="detail-primary-link" href={liveUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
      <span class="en-text">Open Quiet Tarot</span>
      <span class="zh-text">进入静谧塔罗</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</PartDetailLayout>
